WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.067 line:88% align:center
Now let's change the roadmap.

2
00:00:02.117 --> 00:00:05.363 line:88% align:center
You will find that editing happens right where you are looking.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.874 line:88% align:center
Switch to Edit, and every name and every date becomes a field.

4
00:00:10.924 --> 00:00:12.076 line:88% align:center
Click one and type.

5
00:00:12.126 --> 00:00:15.683 line:88% align:center
There is no save button, your changes are kept as you go.

6
00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:17.547 line:88% align:center
To add an activity,

7
00:00:17.597 --> 00:00:21.282 line:88% align:center
type a name in the highlighted row at the end of a workstream

8
00:00:21.332 --> 00:00:22.262 line:88% align:center
and press Enter.

9
00:00:22.312 --> 00:00:25.998 line:88% align:center
Keep typing to add the next one, much as you would in a list.

10
00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:28.483 line:88% align:center
New rows start without dates,

11
00:00:28.533 --> 00:00:32.076 line:88% align:center
because you often know the work before you know the timing.

12
00:00:32.126 --> 00:00:35.791 line:88% align:center
Click the timeline to place one, or give it only a start date

13
00:00:35.841 --> 00:00:38.288 line:88% align:center
and its bar fades out towards the future.

14
00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:42.961 line:88% align:center
The chips above the table choose what is written beside each bar.

15
00:00:43.011 --> 00:00:46.388 line:88% align:center
And each eye hides something from View and from exports.

16
00:00:46.438 --> 00:00:47.979 line:88% align:center
Here in Edit it only dims,

17
00:00:48.029 --> 00:00:51.774 line:88% align:center
and the eye stays exactly where it was, so nothing jumps about

18
00:00:51.824 --> 00:00:53.487 line:88% align:center
and nothing is out of reach.

